{
  "id": "boiler___exhaust_velocity",
  "title": "Boiler - Exhaust Velocity",
  "description": "Recommended boiler exhaust velocities for various boiler configurations and burner types.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Boiler - Exhaust Velocity\n\nThis tool provides recommended exhaust velocities for different boiler configurations and burner types.\n\n## Boiler Configuration Reference\n\n| Configuration | Velocity (m/s) | Velocity (ft/s) | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Ducts at minimum load | < 4.0 | < 13 | Prevent excessive drafting |\n| Stack at minimum load | < 5.0 | < 16 | Minimum load conditions |\n| One-step burner (on - off) | 5.0 - 8.0 | 16 - 26 | Basic burner control |\n| Two-step burner (high - low) | 10 - 15 | 31 - 49 | Improved modulation |\n| Modulating burner | 15 - 25 | 49 - 82 | Full modulation capability |\n| Soot prevention | 3.0 - 4.0 | 9.8 - 13 | Keep surface free from soot |\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "burner_type",
          "label": "Burner Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Ducts at minimum load",
              "value": "ducts_min"
            },
            {
              "label": "Stack at minimum load",
              "value": "stack_min"
            },
            {
              "label": "One-step burner (on - off)",
              "value": "one_step"
            },
            {
              "label": "Two-step burner (high - low)",
              "value": "two_step"
            },
            {
              "label": "Modulating burner",
              "value": "modulating"
            },
            {
              "label": "Soot prevention (minimum)",
              "value": "soot_min"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "unit_system",
          "label": "Unit System",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Metric (m/s)",
              "value": "metric"
            },
            {
              "label": "Imperial (ft/s)",
              "value": "imperial"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "metric"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "velocity_min",
          "label": "Minimum Recommended Velocity",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "formula": "inputs.burner_type === 'ducts_min' ? 0 : inputs.burner_type === 'stack_min' ? 0 : inputs.burner_type === 'one_step' ? 5.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'two_step' ? 10 : inputs.burner_type === 'modulating' ? 15 : inputs.burner_type === 'soot_min' ? 3.0 : 0"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_max",
          "label": "Maximum Recommended Velocity",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "formula": "inputs.burner_type === 'ducts_min' ? 4.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'stack_min' ? 5.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'one_step' ? 8.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'two_step' ? 15 : inputs.burner_type === 'modulating' ? 25 : inputs.burner_type === 'soot_min' ? 4.0 : 0"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_min_imperial",
          "label": "Minimum Recommended Velocity (Imperial)",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "formula": "(inputs.burner_type === 'ducts_min' ? 0 : inputs.burner_type === 'stack_min' ? 0 : inputs.burner_type === 'one_step' ? 5.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'two_step' ? 10 : inputs.burner_type === 'modulating' ? 15 : inputs.burner_type === 'soot_min' ? 3.0 : 0) * 3.28084"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_max_imperial",
          "label": "Maximum Recommended Velocity (Imperial)",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "formula": "(inputs.burner_type === 'ducts_min' ? 4.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'stack_min' ? 5.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'one_step' ? 8.0 : inputs.burner_type === 'two_step' ? 15 : inputs.burner_type === 'modulating' ? 25 : inputs.burner_type === 'soot_min' ? 4.0 : 0) * 3.28084"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "Boiler Exhaust Velocity Ranges by Configuration",
          "left": "center"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis",
          "axisPointer": {
            "type": "shadow"
          }
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Ducts\n(min load)",
            "Stack\n(min load)",
            "One-step\n(on-off)",
            "Two-step\n(high-low)",
            "Modulating",
            "Soot\nPrevention"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Velocity (m/s)"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Minimum Velocity",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              0,
              0,
              5,
              10,
              15,
              3
            ],
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#3b82f6"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Maximum Velocity",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              4,
              5,
              8,
              15,
              25,
              4
            ],
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#ef4444"
            }
          }
        ],
        "legend": {
          "top": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Boiler Configuration",
        "Min Velocity (m/s)",
        "Max Velocity (m/s)",
        "Min Velocity (ft/s)",
        "Max Velocity (ft/s)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Ducts at minimum load",
          "0 (no limit)",
          "< 4.0",
          "0 (no limit)",
          "< 13"
        ],
        [
          "Stack at minimum load",
          "0 (no limit)",
          "< 5.0",
          "0 (no limit)",
          "< 16"
        ],
        [
          "One-step burner (on - off)",
          "5.0",
          "8.0",
          "16",
          "26"
        ],
        [
          "Two-step burner (high - low)",
          "10",
          "15",
          "31",
          "49"
        ],
        [
          "Modulating burner",
          "15",
          "25",
          "49",
          "82"
        ],
        [
          "Soot prevention (minimum)",
          "3.0",
          "4.0",
          "9.8",
          "13"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}